# Public Key Infrastructure (PKI)

The lab uses a two-tier certificate authority.

## Offline Root CA

Purpose:

- Root trust anchor
- Offline storage
- Rarely powered on
- Used only for signing subordinate CA certificates
    

---

## Online Intermediate CA

Purpose:

- Certificate issuance
- Server certificates
- Client certificates
- Internal TLS
    

Current work includes distributing trusted certificates to:

- Ubuntu
- Rocky Linux
- Kali Linux
- Arch Linux
- Windows 11
- macOS
    

Ansible automatically installs:

- Root CA
- Intermediate CA
    

onto managed systems.

