# Configuration Management

Configuration management is handled through Ansible.

Directory structure includes:

```
ansible/
├── inventory/
├── group_vars/
├── host_vars/
├── playbooks/
├── roles/
└── templates/
```

Infrastructure is deployed using reusable roles.

Current roles include:

- Common configuration
- Linux updates
- PKI trust
- Join Domain for Linux
    

Future planned roles include:

- ElasticAgent install
- Security hardening
- Backup configuration
- Monitoring
- VMware integration
    

