# Long-Term Vision

The ultimate goal of this homelab is to replicate many of the core technologies found in a modern enterprise while emphasizing automation, 
repeatability, and security. Every service should be deployable through code, integrated with centralized identity and PKI, 
monitored through centralized logging, and secured using industry best practices.

As additional services are added—such as FreeIPA, automated certificate issuance, vulnerability scanning, backups, and monitoring—the environment will evolve into a fully automated enterprise lab capable of supporting realistic testing, skills development, and portfolio demonstrations for senior systems administration, infrastructure engineering, and cybersecurity roles.
